{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Pals 2 is the ultimate desktop companion game, which allows you to share your desktop with a cute companion of your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/19c46d1bc0a8884a36ddc405226d9b31.poster.avif?t=1763325701\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/19c46d1bc0a8884a36ddc405226d9b31.webm?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/19c46d1bc0a8884a36ddc405226d9b31.mp4?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe in trying before buying. You have access to all functionality! If you enjoy the game and want to support it you can get Desktop Pals Gold and unlock more pals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/a4233ad9062e87808432e887f463bc14.poster.avif?t=1763325701\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/a4233ad9062e87808432e887f463bc14.webm?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/a4233ad9062e87808432e887f463bc14.mp4?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pals are fully interactive with natural behaviour patterns, and you can also overlay them over your favorite games, so you always have something to do while loading in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/4a17296e331d91c0f797406858f1d84a.poster.avif?t=1763325701\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/4a17296e331d91c0f797406858f1d84a.webm?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/4a17296e331d91c0f797406858f1d84a.mp4?t=1763325701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features extensive ustomization. You can choose the pals location on your screen, his size, how active he is and more! You can modify the game to your liking.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592310?t=1763325701","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/267056c772e8f4960cf85ab118751f6810e9cec0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763325701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/696fe3eac78ce7d7821aa98579c4bf574a87e3fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763325701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/696fe3eac78ce7d7821aa98579c4bf574a87e3fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763325701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Pals 2 is the ultimate desktop companion game, which allows you to share your desktop with a cute companion of your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/extras/19c46d1bc0a8884a36ddc405226d9b31.poster.avif?t=1763325701\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592310/e